      NOT CLOSED: publish size (main session measures by instruction); manual live gate (a)-(f) pending (144 cutover +
      deploy; (e) needs the owner's explicit acceptance of replay); OWNER DECISIONS: F8 follow-up (persisted human
      creator column for app-created rows, before task 150) and whether the round-4 Assign-cascade acceptance extends to
      COMPENSATION (POML trigger options a/b/c) - recorded, not decided here.
    </outcome>
    <outcome date="2026-10-02" branch="task/uac-r2-133-r1-r2" round="verifier-2">
