          (a) Step 4.2: a shared container is UNLINKED before the move (first write, after every read); every failure
              after the move leaves "owned, no container" = resumed (tested). A failed unlink: new code
              sdap.provision.shared_container_not_cleared (500, retryable, nothing moved). Later details say "unlinked".
          (b) A kept record moves only when share-first is possible: an unreadable pre-call share set refuses before any
