              fallback for a creator who owns the record is kept (refusing would refuse every re-securing if (a) fails).
          (c) Every failure after a kept record's move tells the truth: extension containerKept; the detail says the next
              call answers already_provisioned and does not resume, and names the recovery that works - an administrator's
              Manage Access share (or Share in the model-driven app); CRITICAL logs say it; the double failure says when
              the creator's share was confirmed before the move and still stands. Tested for every failure after the move
